WEBVTT

00:09.310 --> 00:10.311
ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.411 --> 00:12.113
Kids:
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：
是的，是的，队长！

00:12.213 --> 00:13.447
I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.547 --> 00:15.516
Kids:
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!!
孩子们：
是的，是的，队长！

00:15.616 --> 00:18.419
* OOH!
*哦！

00:18.519 --> 00:20.588
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:20.688 --> 00:22.556
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:22.656 --> 00:24.325
* ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE *
* 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:24.425 --> 00:26.327
* SPONGEBOB
SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝
方裤！ *

00:26.427 --> 00:28.662
* IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH *
*如果航海废话
成为您所希望的*

00:28.762 --> 00:30.198
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:30.298 --> 00:32.366
* THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH *
* 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑腾*

00:32.466 --> 00:34.635
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
READY?
* 海绵宝宝！ *
准备好？

00:34.735 --> 00:36.637
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:36.737 --> 00:38.839
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:38.939 --> 00:40.574
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:40.674 --> 00:44.112
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:44.212 --> 00:46.447
( hearty laughter )
（爽朗的笑声）

00:46.547 --> 00:49.150
( flute playing )
（长笛演奏）

00:56.056 --> 00:59.727
and NICKELODEON]
和尼克频道]

01:02.563 --> 01:03.431
( snores )
（打鼾）

01:03.531 --> 01:04.632
( meows )
（喵）

01:04.732 --> 01:05.599
( snores )
（打鼾）

01:05.699 --> 01:06.767
( meows )
（喵）

01:06.867 --> 01:07.601
WAKE UP, GARY.
醒来，加里。

01:07.701 --> 01:08.736
( meows quizzically )
（疑惑地喵喵叫）

01:08.836 --> 01:09.870
WE'RE MOVING TODAY.
我们今天要搬家了。

01:09.970 --> 01:10.804
( meows )
（喵）

01:10.904 --> 01:11.805
THAT'S RIGHT.
这是正确的。

01:11.905 --> 01:12.973
WE'RE LEAVING HOME.
我们要离开家了。

01:13.141 --> 01:14.708
WE'RE GOING TO BECOME PEASANTS.
我们要成为农民。

01:14.808 --> 01:15.843
( meows )
（喵）

01:15.943 --> 01:17.178
NO MORE FOOD.
没有更多的食物了。

01:17.278 --> 01:18.346
SORRY, GARY.
对不起，加里。

01:18.446 --> 01:21.215
PEASANTS ONLY EAT
MASHED-UP CLAMSHELLS.
农民只吃
混合蛤壳。

01:22.183 --> 01:24.618
( sobbing meow )
（呜呜呜）

01:24.718 --> 01:27.555
( sobbing )
（抽泣）

01:27.655 --> 01:29.390
APRIL FOOLS!
愚人节！

01:29.490 --> 01:31.459
THERE YOU GO, PAL.
好了，朋友。

01:31.559 --> 01:34.162
WHOO, I'M THIRSTY.
哇，我渴了。

01:35.196 --> 01:38.532
THIS IS AN EXTREME THIRST.
这是极度的口渴。

01:41.068 --> 01:42.002
WHEW.
哇。

01:42.170 --> 01:43.704
I'M EXHAUSTED.
我累极了。

01:43.804 --> 01:46.707
I SURE CAN'T WAIT
TO DRINK ALL THESE DRINKS.
我肯定等不及了
喝掉所有这些饮料。

01:46.807 --> 01:49.343
APRIL FOOLS!
愚人节！

01:49.443 --> 01:51.179
TO ME.
大部头书。

01:51.279 --> 01:53.547
( braying laughter )
（嘶哑的笑声）

01:53.647 --> 01:56.049
( laughing )
（笑）

01:58.619 --> 02:00.221
HMM.
唔。

02:00.321 --> 02:04.425
WHAT'S HE SO HAPPY ABOUT?
他为什么这么高兴？

02:08.196 --> 02:11.699
APRIL FOOLS' DAY IS
SPONGEBOB'S FAVORITE HOLIDAY.
愚人节是
海绵宝宝最喜欢的假期。

02:13.701 --> 02:16.204
MR. KRABS,
I CAN'T COME IN TODAY.
先生。螃蟹，
我今天不能进来。

02:16.270 --> 02:18.406
I CAUGHT SOMETHING TERRIBLE.
我发现了一些可怕的事情。

02:18.506 --> 02:19.607
WHAT'D YOU CATCH?
你抓到了什么？

02:19.707 --> 02:21.775
I CAUGHT SIGHT
OF THE CALENDAR.
我看见了
日历的。

02:21.875 --> 02:22.776
OH.
哦。

02:22.876 --> 02:23.811
HOLD ON, SQUIDWARD.
坚持住，章鱼哥。

02:23.911 --> 02:25.513
There's someone here to see you.
有人来见你。

02:25.613 --> 02:27.815
Says he's
from the Barnacle Bay Art Museum
说他是
来自藤壶湾艺术博物馆

02:27.915 --> 02:30.851
and he wants to honor you
as artist of the month.
他想尊重你
作为本月的艺术家。

02:33.621 --> 02:37.024
I HAVE ARRIVED.
我已经到了。

02:37.124 --> 02:38.091
( giggling )
（咯咯笑）

02:38.226 --> 02:39.126
WHAT?
什么？

02:39.227 --> 02:40.328
WHAT'S SO FUNNY?
有什么好笑的？

02:40.428 --> 02:42.062
WHERE'S THE ART DEALER?
艺术品经销商在哪里？

02:42.230 --> 02:43.931
( laughing )
（笑）

02:44.031 --> 02:45.899
YOU JUST MISSED HIM.
你只是想念他。

02:45.999 --> 02:48.135
YEAH, BUT HE TOLD US
TO TELL YOU...
是的，但他告诉我们
告诉你...

02:48.236 --> 02:49.703
( snickering )
（窃笑）

02:49.803 --> 02:51.439
HEY, TELL ME WHAT?
嘿，告诉我什么？

02:51.539 --> 02:54.242
HE TOLD ME TO TELL YOU
他让我告诉你

02:54.342 --> 02:56.877
APRIL FOOLS.
愚人节。

02:59.480 --> 03:01.515
WELL, IT'S BEEN NICE
WORKING HERE.
嗯，很好
在这里工作。

03:01.615 --> 03:03.584
THANKS FOR EVERYTHING,
MR. KRABS.
感谢所做的一切，
先生。螃蟹。

03:03.684 --> 03:04.852
SQUIDWARD, WAIT.
章鱼哥，等等。

03:04.952 --> 03:07.821
JUST SEND MY LAST CHECK
TO THE P.O. BOX, MR. KRABS.
只需发送我的最后一张支票
致邮政信箱博克斯先生。螃蟹。

03:07.921 --> 03:10.724
SQUIDWARD, IT WAS JUST A JOKE.
章鱼哥，这只是个玩笑。

03:10.824 --> 03:12.293
NO MORE JOKES
ON YOU TODAY.
别再开玩笑了
今天就在你身上。

03:12.393 --> 03:13.261
I PROMISE.
我保证。

03:13.361 --> 03:14.895
YOU DO?
你做？

03:14.995 --> 03:16.063
SURE.
当然。

03:16.163 --> 03:18.966
THERE'S LOTS OF OTHER
WILLING PARTICIPANTS.
还有很多其他的
愿意的参与者。

03:19.066 --> 03:20.100
RIGHT, MR. KRABS?
对了，先生。螃蟹？

03:20.268 --> 03:21.369
( raspberry )
（ 覆盆子 ）

03:21.469 --> 03:22.403
( laughing )
（笑）

03:22.503 --> 03:25.005
WELL, AS LONG
AS IT'S NOT ME.
好吧，只要
因为这不是我。

03:27.675 --> 03:28.609
EXCUSE ME.
打扰一下。

03:28.709 --> 03:32.045
COULD YOU TELL ME
WHERE THE FORKS ARE?
你能告诉我吗
叉子在哪里？

03:32.980 --> 03:35.883
THEY'RE RIGHT
HERE, LADY.
他们是对的
在这里，女士。

03:35.983 --> 03:38.185
OH, BUT THIS IS A SPOON.
哦，但这是一把勺子。

03:38.286 --> 03:41.422
APRIL FOOLS!
愚人节！

03:41.522 --> 03:42.356
OH.
哦。

03:42.456 --> 03:44.358
( laughs )
（笑）

03:47.060 --> 03:48.161
HUH...
呃……

03:49.397 --> 03:51.399
WELCOME TO THE KRUSTY KRAB.
欢迎来到脆皮蟹。

03:51.499 --> 03:52.900
HOW MAY I HELP YOU?
我能为您提供什么帮助？

03:53.000 --> 03:57.305
YEAH. GIVE ME TWO LARGE FRIES
AND A JUMBO KRABBY PATTY.
是的。给我两份大薯条
还有巨型蟹肉饼。

03:57.371 --> 03:59.172
HEY, WHAT'S THAT?
嘿，那是什么？

04:00.308 --> 04:02.142
OH, I DIDN'T
SEE ANYTHING...
哦，我没有
看到任何东西...

04:02.310 --> 04:04.011
HEY, WHERE'D THAT OTHER GUY GO?
嘿，那个家伙去哪儿了？

04:04.111 --> 04:05.379
APRIL FOOLS!
愚人节！

04:05.479 --> 04:07.080
I'M RIGHT HERE.
我就在这里。

04:07.180 --> 04:08.982
( laughs )
（笑）

04:09.082 --> 04:10.918
HEY, THAT WAS PRETTY GOOD.
嘿，那太好了。

04:11.018 --> 04:12.320
( laughs )
（笑）

04:14.322 --> 04:16.657
WHAT ARE YOU DOING
BEHIND THE COUNTER?
你在做什么
在柜台后面？

04:20.093 --> 04:21.094
EXCUSE ME.
打扰一下。

04:21.194 --> 04:22.129
CAN I GET
我可以得到吗

04:22.229 --> 04:23.831
A COUPLE ICE CUBES
IN HERE PLEASE?
几个冰块
请问在这儿吗？

04:23.931 --> 04:24.798
SURE.
当然。

04:24.898 --> 04:27.100
A COUPLE OF ICE CUBES
COMING UP.
几个冰块
即将到来。

04:27.200 --> 04:29.337
( whistling )
（吹口哨）

04:29.370 --> 04:30.638
HERE YOU GO.
干得好。

04:30.738 --> 04:31.539
THANKS.
谢谢。

04:31.639 --> 04:32.940
( wheezing squeak )
（喘息声）

04:33.040 --> 04:34.041
HUH?
嗯？

04:34.141 --> 04:35.609
( chuckling squeak )
（咯咯笑声）

04:35.709 --> 04:36.710
HMM?
唔？

04:36.810 --> 04:38.646
( slurps )
（啜饮）

04:38.746 --> 04:39.813
AH...
啊...

04:39.913 --> 04:43.083
( laughing )
（笑）

04:43.183 --> 04:44.685
APRIL FOOLS!
愚人节！

04:44.785 --> 04:46.186
WHAT DID YOU DO
TO MY DRINK?!
你做了什么
我的饮料？！

04:46.354 --> 04:48.889
I... I...
我...我...

04:48.989 --> 04:50.223
YOU WHAT?!
你什么？！

04:50.358 --> 04:53.727
YOU ASKED FOR A COUPLE
OF ICE CUBES IN YOUR DRINK
你要了一对
饮料中的冰块数量

04:53.827 --> 04:56.163
AND I ONLY PUT IN ONE!
而且我只放了一个！

04:56.263 --> 04:57.731
( laughs )
（笑）

04:57.831 --> 05:00.868
I GUESS THAT IS
PRETTY FUNNY.
我想那就是
很有趣。

05:00.968 --> 05:03.170
( laughs )
（笑）

05:03.270 --> 05:04.372
YEAH.
是的。

05:05.873 --> 05:07.207
( SpongeBob laughing )
（海绵宝宝大笑）

05:07.375 --> 05:08.642
( grumbling )
（抱怨）

05:14.382 --> 05:15.883
( laughter continues )
（笑声继续）

05:15.983 --> 05:18.652
HEY, YOUR SHOE'S UNTIED.
嘿，你的鞋带解开了。

05:18.752 --> 05:20.287
APRIL FOOLS!
愚人节！

05:20.388 --> 05:23.223
YOU'RE NOT WEARING SHOES.
你没穿鞋。

05:23.391 --> 05:24.992
( laughing )
（笑）

05:26.960 --> 05:28.896
( laughing into microphone )
（对着麦克风笑）

05:35.268 --> 05:37.738
APRIL FOOLS!
愚人节！

05:37.838 --> 05:39.006
OH! THAT'S IT!
哦！就是这样！

05:39.106 --> 05:41.975
SPONGEBOB AND HIS STUPID PRANKS.
海绵宝宝和他的愚蠢恶作剧。

05:42.075 --> 05:45.212
I'M GOING TO SHOW HIM
WHAT A REAL PRANK IS ALL ABOUT.
我要给他看
真正的恶作剧是什么？

05:47.415 --> 05:48.782
( chortles )
（咯咯笑）

05:48.882 --> 05:51.251
( humming )
（嗡嗡声）

05:51.419 --> 05:52.986
HMM?
唔？

05:53.687 --> 05:54.522
OH, BOY.
哦，男孩。

05:54.622 --> 05:56.289
SOMETHING FOR ME TO CLEAN UP.
需要我清理的东西。

05:56.424 --> 05:58.892
( snickers )
（士力架）

06:05.265 --> 06:07.701
APRIL FOOLS!
愚人节！

06:08.436 --> 06:10.704
WHOA!
哇啊！

06:14.307 --> 06:18.579
WHOA!
哇啊！

06:18.679 --> 06:23.116
( SpongeBob screaming )
（海绵宝宝尖叫）

06:23.216 --> 06:25.152
All:
OH, NO.
全部：
哦，不。

06:25.252 --> 06:28.021
( laughing hysterically )
（歇斯底里地大笑）

06:28.789 --> 06:32.926
( SpongeBob screaming )
（海绵宝宝尖叫）

06:33.894 --> 06:34.928
( all gasping )
（全都气喘吁吁）

06:35.028 --> 06:36.797
( continues laughing )
（继续笑）

06:36.897 --> 06:38.899
( continues screaming )
（继续尖叫）

06:38.999 --> 06:40.701
( all gasping )
（全都气喘吁吁）

06:40.801 --> 06:41.702
OH, OH, OW.
哦，哦，哦。

06:41.802 --> 06:44.171
I'LL CATCH YOU, SPONGEBOB.
我会抓住你的，海绵宝宝。

06:44.271 --> 06:46.106
( snickering )
（窃笑）

06:46.206 --> 06:50.478
( Spongebob screaming )
（海绵宝宝尖叫）

06:51.612 --> 06:52.713
OOPS.
哎呀。

06:52.813 --> 06:54.682
( customers' dismayed gasps )
（顾客惊愕的喘息声）

07:00.721 --> 07:01.655
APRIL FOOLS!
愚人节！

07:01.755 --> 07:03.356
YOU LITTLE SAUSAGE.
你这个小香肠。

07:03.491 --> 07:04.958
( laughing )
（笑）

07:05.058 --> 07:07.060
( whimpers )
（呜咽）

07:07.160 --> 07:10.197
( sobbing )
（抽泣）

07:10.297 --> 07:12.733
SPONGEBOB, I WAS JUST KIDDING.
海绵宝宝，我只是开玩笑。

07:12.833 --> 07:14.134
COME ON, COME ON.
来吧，来吧。

07:14.234 --> 07:17.037
YOU GUYS KNOW
I WAS JUST KIDDING.
你们知道
我只是开玩笑。

07:17.137 --> 07:18.038
RIGHT?
正确的？

07:18.138 --> 07:21.174
OH, MAN, POOR KID.
哦，伙计，可怜的孩子。

07:21.274 --> 07:24.578
THAT GUY HAS DEFINITELY GOT
SOME ISSUES TO WORK OUT.
那家伙肯定已经得到了
一些需要解决的问题。

07:27.014 --> 07:28.148
APRIL FOOLS...
愚人节...

07:28.248 --> 07:29.149
JERK.
混蛋。

07:29.249 --> 07:31.384
WAIT, DON'T GO.
等等，别走。

07:31.519 --> 07:34.087
HEY, YOU STINK!
嘿，你太臭了！

07:34.187 --> 07:35.823
WAIT, WAIT, WAIT.
等等，等等，等等。

07:35.923 --> 07:37.224
IT WAS A JOKE.
这是一个笑话。

07:37.357 --> 07:38.592
UH-HUH.
嗯嗯。

07:39.660 --> 07:40.994
OH...
哦...

07:41.795 --> 07:43.797
OH...
哦...

07:44.832 --> 07:48.068
( groaning )
（呻吟）

07:48.168 --> 07:53.340
WHY IS IT WHENEVER I'M
HAVING FUN, IT'S WRONG?
为什么每次我都这样
玩得开心，有错吗？

07:53.440 --> 07:55.809
I DIDN'T MEAN TO MAKE HIM CRY.
我不是故意让他哭的。

07:55.909 --> 07:59.079
I GUESS THIS MEANS
I BETTER TELL SPONGEBOB
我想这意味着
我最好告诉海绵宝宝

07:59.179 --> 08:02.382
I'M SORR... ECH...
我很抱歉...呃...

08:02.550 --> 08:06.887
I GUESS THIS MEANS
I BETTER APOLOG... EE-YI!
我想这意味着
我最好道歉……哎呀！

08:06.987 --> 08:11.024
THIS IS GOING TO BE
TOUGHER THAN I THOUGHT.
这将会是
比我想象的更难。

08:13.226 --> 08:14.795
( clears throat noisily )
（大声清嗓子）

08:14.895 --> 08:16.463
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

08:16.564 --> 08:19.132
UH, SPONGEBOB, COME ON OUT.
呃，海绵宝宝，出来吧。

08:19.232 --> 08:21.702
I'VE GOT SOMETHING TO TELL YOU.
我有话要告诉你。

08:21.802 --> 08:23.771
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

08:24.705 --> 08:25.573
OH, HUH?
哦，嗯？

08:27.875 --> 08:32.913
SPONGEBOB, UH, I WAS THINKING
ABOUT TODAY AND...
海绵宝宝，呃，我在想
关于今天和...

08:33.013 --> 08:35.082
AND, WELL, IT JUST SEEMS
而且，嗯，看起来

08:35.182 --> 08:39.052
THAT MAYBE I MIGHT
OWE YOU SOME SORT OF...
也许我可能
我们欠你一些……

08:39.152 --> 08:41.589
THIS ISN'T SOMETHING
I NORMALLY DO.
这不是什么
我通常这样做。

08:41.622 --> 08:44.858
SO, SO, LISTEN CAREFULLY,
SPONGEBOB
所以，所以，仔细听，
海绵宝宝

08:44.958 --> 08:47.895
BECAUSE I'M ABOUT
TO TELL YOU THAT I'M...
因为我即将
告诉你我是...

08:47.995 --> 08:49.296
THAT I'M... WHAT?
我是……什么？

08:50.397 --> 08:52.666
PATRICK, WHAT ARE YOU
DOING HERE?
帕特里克，你是谁
在这里做什么？

08:52.766 --> 08:53.967
DIGGING.
挖掘。

08:54.067 --> 08:56.436
WHY ARE YOU
WEARING THAT HAT?
你为什么
戴着那顶帽子？

08:56.604 --> 08:57.805
OH, I DON'T KNOW.
哦，我不知道。

08:57.905 --> 08:58.839
OH.
哦。

08:58.939 --> 09:00.808
WHERE'S SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝在哪里？

09:00.908 --> 09:02.475
HE'S IN THE HOUSE.
他在房子里。

09:02.610 --> 09:03.844
HE'S IMPRESSED.
他印象深刻。

09:03.944 --> 09:04.845
WITH WHAT?
用什么？

09:04.945 --> 09:05.913
I DON'T KNOW
我不知道

09:06.013 --> 09:07.715
BUT IT MUST HAVE BEEN
PRETTY GOOD
但它一定是
相当不错

09:07.815 --> 09:09.249
TO MAKE HIM CRY LIKE THAT.
让他哭成那样。

09:09.349 --> 09:11.084
OH!
哦！

09:11.184 --> 09:12.853
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

09:12.953 --> 09:15.322
SPONGEBOB, LET ME IN THERE.
海绵宝宝，让我进去。

09:18.692 --> 09:20.493
SPONGEBOB, YOU BETTER
LET ME IN THERE.
海绵宝宝，你更好
让我进去。

09:20.628 --> 09:22.229
I DON'T WANT
TO HAVE TO USE THIS.
我不想要
必须使用这个。

09:22.329 --> 09:24.632
( playing out-of-tune melody )
（演奏跑调的旋律）

09:24.732 --> 09:25.999
WHAT DO YOU WANT?
你想要什么？

09:26.099 --> 09:28.769
SPONGEBOB, I JUST WANT TO SAY
海绵宝宝，我只想说

09:28.869 --> 09:31.639
THAT I'M SOOOO... RRY.
我太……RRY了。

09:31.639 --> 09:32.806
WHAT?
什么？

09:32.906 --> 09:36.176
I'M TRYING TO SAY I'M...
我想说我是...

09:36.276 --> 09:38.646
( brays like a donkey )
（像驴一样叫）

09:38.679 --> 09:39.713
WHAT?
什么？

09:39.813 --> 09:43.350
I'M JUST TRYING TO SAY I'M...
我只是想说我...

09:46.787 --> 09:50.223
THERE'S GOT TO BE
AN EASIER WAY TO DO THIS.
一定有
一种更简单的方法。

09:50.958 --> 09:53.694
( humming )
（嗡嗡声）

10:00.300 --> 10:02.269
WELL, AREN'T YOU
GOING TO OPEN IT?
好吧，你不是吗？
要打开它吗？

10:02.369 --> 10:03.236
I CAN'T.
我不能。

10:03.336 --> 10:04.872
I DON'T HAVE
A BOTTLE OPENER.
我没有
开瓶器。

10:04.972 --> 10:06.173
OH!
哦！

10:11.611 --> 10:14.014
SPONGEBOB, I'M...
海绵宝宝，我...

10:14.114 --> 10:15.949
( whispering )
（低声）

10:16.049 --> 10:18.952
( sawing noises )
WHAT?
（锯切声）
什么？

10:19.052 --> 10:20.988
WH-WH-WHAT?
什么-什么-什么？

10:25.492 --> 10:27.227
OH!
哦！

10:27.327 --> 10:34.134
SPONGEBOB, ALL I AM TRYING
TO SAY IS THAT I AM...
海绵宝宝，我正在努力
要说的是我是...

10:35.736 --> 10:37.070
( muted ):
SORRY.
（静音）：
抱歉。

10:37.170 --> 10:39.006
THERE YOU GO.
就这样吧。

10:39.106 --> 10:39.773
BUT I COULDN'T...
但我不能...

10:39.873 --> 10:40.908
I DON'T CARE.
我不在乎。

10:41.008 --> 10:41.909
I SAID IT.
我说过了。

10:42.009 --> 10:43.977
MY CONSCIENCE IS CLEAR.
我的良心是清白的。

10:44.077 --> 10:48.015
MUST HAVE BEEN PRETTY GOOD
TO MAKE HIM CRY LIKE THAT.
一定非常好
让他哭成那样。

10:50.684 --> 10:51.651
WHAT?
什么？

10:51.752 --> 10:52.619
APRIL FOOLS...
愚人节...

10:52.720 --> 10:53.854
JERK.
混蛋。

10:55.588 --> 10:57.590
YOU STINK!
你太臭了！

10:59.326 --> 11:01.561
ALL RIGHT, ALL RIGHT,
I'M SORRY, I'M SORRY.
好吧，好吧，
对不起，对不起。

11:01.729 --> 11:03.030
I ADMIT IT, I'M SORRY!
我承认，我很抱歉！

11:03.130 --> 11:04.732
I DIDN'T MEAN TO HURT YOU.
我无意伤害你。

11:04.765 --> 11:06.734
IN FACT, SPONGEBOB, I LIKE YOU.
事实上，海绵宝宝，我喜欢你。

11:06.800 --> 11:07.835
I LIKE LIVING NEXT DOOR.
我喜欢住在隔壁。

11:07.935 --> 11:09.837
I LIKE YOUR FOGHORN ALARM
IN THE MORNING
我喜欢你的雾号警报器
早上

11:09.937 --> 11:12.039
AND YOUR HIGH-PITCHED GIGGLING
AT NIGHT.
还有你高亢的咯咯笑声
晚上。

11:12.139 --> 11:15.508
I ALSO LIKE GARY, PATRICK,
SANDY, MR. KRABS
我也喜欢加里、帕特里克、
桑迪先生。蟹蟹

11:15.608 --> 11:16.777
AND ALL OF THE OTHER PEOPLE
以及所有其他人

11:16.877 --> 11:18.278
I'M FORCED TO BE
IN CONTACT WITH.
我是被迫的
接触。

11:18.378 --> 11:19.579
AND-AND-AND-AND...
与-与-与-与...

11:19.747 --> 11:21.548
SQUIDWARD, IS ALL THAT TRUE?
章鱼哥，这一切都是真的吗？

11:21.648 --> 11:23.951
YES, YES, SPONGEBOB.
是的，是的，海绵宝宝。

11:24.051 --> 11:26.253
YES, IT'S ALL TRUE.
是的，这都是真的。

11:26.353 --> 11:28.822
EVEN THE PART ABOUT THE LIMA
BEANS AND THE CAR CHASE?
甚至关于利马的部分
豆子和汽车追逐？

11:28.922 --> 11:30.157
THE WHAT?
什么？

11:30.257 --> 11:31.358
YES, YES, WHATEVER
是的，是的，无论如何

11:31.458 --> 11:33.226
BUT YOU HAVE TO PROMISE
NOT TO TELL ANYBODY.
但你必须承诺
不要告诉任何人。

11:33.326 --> 11:34.127
I PROMISE.
我保证。

11:34.227 --> 11:34.928
REALLY?
真的吗？

11:35.028 --> 11:37.898
All:
APRIL FOOLS!
全部：
愚人节！

11:37.998 --> 11:42.302
( muttering gibberish )
（嘟囔着胡言乱语）

11:42.402 --> 11:43.270
APRIL FOOLS!
愚人节！

11:43.370 --> 11:45.438
YOU'RE RIGHT-- APRIL FOOLS.
你是对的——愚人节。

11:45.538 --> 11:47.040
I JUST FOOLED YOU ALL.
我刚刚愚弄了你们所有人。

11:47.140 --> 11:50.643
( laughing hysterically )
（歇斯底里地大笑）

11:50.778 --> 11:53.180
WHAT WOULD WE DO
WITHOUT SQUIDWARD?
我们会做什么
没有章鱼哥？

12:07.795 --> 12:09.096
AH!
啊！

12:09.196 --> 12:10.197
OOH!
哦！

12:10.297 --> 12:11.298
OH!
哦！

12:11.398 --> 12:12.499
OOH!
哦！

12:12.599 --> 12:13.533
AH!
啊！

12:13.633 --> 12:14.802
OOH!
哦！

12:14.902 --> 12:16.303
AH!
啊！

12:16.403 --> 12:17.270
OOH!
哦！

12:17.370 --> 12:18.505
AH!
啊！

12:18.605 --> 12:21.141
BEHOLD THE ULTIMATE
COOKING UTENSIL--
见证终极
炊具--

12:21.241 --> 12:23.110
THE GOLDEN SPATULA!
金色抹刀！

12:23.210 --> 12:25.378
HEY, SPONGEBOB,
LOOK WHAT IT SAYS HERE:
嘿，海绵宝宝，
看看这里怎么说：

12:25.478 --> 12:27.948
"MANY HAVE TRIED
TO PULL THIS SPATULA
“许多人已经尝试过
拉这个抹刀

12:28.048 --> 12:31.118
"FROM THIS ANCIENT GREASE
AND ALL HAVE FAILED.
“来自这种古老的油脂
但一切都失败了。

12:31.218 --> 12:33.286
( grunting loudly )
（大声咕哝）

12:33.386 --> 12:34.487
"ONLY A FRY COOK
“只是一个炒菜厨师

12:34.587 --> 12:36.990
"WORTHY OF KING NEPTUNE HIMSELF
CAN WIELD...
“无愧于海王星国王本人
可以使用...

12:37.124 --> 12:40.427
"THE GOLDEN SPATULA."
THE GOLDEN SPATULA."
“金铲子。”
金铲。”

12:40.527 --> 12:42.295
WOW.
WOW.
哇。
哇。

12:42.395 --> 12:43.363
OH, OH, OH, OH!
哦，哦，哦，哦！

12:43.463 --> 12:45.465
TAKE A PICTURE OF ME
AND THE SPATULA.
给我拍张照片
还有抹刀。

12:47.067 --> 12:48.836
OKAY, I'M READY!
好的，我准备好了！

12:48.902 --> 12:50.737
EXCUSE ME...
打扰一下...

12:50.838 --> 12:53.173
DO YOU KNOW
WHERE THE MENU
SECTION IS?
你知道吗
菜单在哪里
部分是？

12:53.273 --> 12:55.175
UH...
呃……

12:55.275 --> 12:56.476
THE MENU
SECTION?
菜单
部分？

12:56.576 --> 12:57.444
THAT'S EASY.
这很简单。

12:57.544 --> 12:59.212
IT'S OVER THAT WAY.
就这样结束了。

13:00.380 --> 13:01.348
UH-OH.
呃-哦。

13:01.448 --> 13:03.316
HOLY SMOKES!
神圣的烟雾！

13:03.416 --> 13:05.018
RUDE!
粗鲁的！

13:05.118 --> 13:06.854
HEY, THE LIGHT CHANGED.
嘿，光线变了。

13:06.887 --> 13:08.055
UH, PATRICK...
呃，帕特里克……

13:08.155 --> 13:09.890
HOLD ON.
ALMOST THERE.
坚持，稍等。
快到了。

13:09.990 --> 13:12.459
( booming laughter )
（爆笑声）

13:12.559 --> 13:15.863
YES, YES, AT LAST--
是的，是的，最后——

13:15.963 --> 13:19.466
SOMEONE WORTHY OF BEING
THE ROYAL FRY COOK!
一个值得存在的人
皇家油炸厨师！

13:19.566 --> 13:23.536
WHO HAS FREED THE SPATULA
FROM THE GREASE?
谁释放了抹刀
来自油脂？

13:23.636 --> 13:25.638
UH, I DID,
MR. NEPTUNE, SIR.
呃，我做到了，
先生。海王星，先生。

13:25.738 --> 13:27.440
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS.
海绵宝宝。

13:27.540 --> 13:31.644
( rumbling )
( laughing )
（隆隆声）
（笑）

13:31.744 --> 13:34.347
( rumbling stops )
A FINE JEST, BOY.
（隆隆声停止）
一个很好的玩笑，孩子。

13:34.447 --> 13:37.617
YOU ARE BUT A LOWLY
YELLOW SPONGE.
你只是一个卑微的人
黄色海绵。

13:37.717 --> 13:39.152
PUNY...
弱小...

13:39.252 --> 13:40.653
INSIGNIFICANT...
微不足道...

13:40.753 --> 13:41.922
A COMMONER.
一个平民。

13:42.022 --> 13:46.326
THEREFORE, YOU COULD NEVER
BE FRY COOK TO A GOD AND...
因此，你永远不能
成为上帝的炒菜厨师......

13:46.426 --> 13:48.962
THIS IS WHY IT IS FUNNY!
这就是为什么它很有趣！

13:49.062 --> 13:50.998
( rumbling )
( laughing )
（隆隆声）
（笑）

13:51.098 --> 13:54.767
NOW STEP ASIDE WHILE I SEEK OUT
THE TRUE FRY COOK.
现在让开，我去寻找
真正的油炸厨师。

13:56.503 --> 13:57.905
NO, NO, NO... HMM...
不，不，不……嗯……

13:57.971 --> 13:59.907
NO, NOT YOU,
YOU'RE TOO SHORT, NO.
不，不是你，
你太矮了，不。

13:59.973 --> 14:01.208
AH!
啊！

14:02.042 --> 14:02.775
BUT... BUT...
但是...但是...

14:02.910 --> 14:05.012
A PURVEYOR OF FOODS.
食品供应商。

14:05.112 --> 14:08.681
YES, YOU MUST BE
MY NEW FRY COOK.
是的，你一定是
我的新炒菜厨师。

14:08.781 --> 14:09.917
UH, SORRY,
KING NEPTUNE.
呃，抱歉，
海王星国王。

14:10.017 --> 14:11.718
I DON'T MAKE THEM;
I JUST SELL THEM.
我不做；
我只是卖掉它们。

14:11.818 --> 14:14.487
THEN WHO PULLED
UP THE SPATULA?
然后谁拉
向上铲？

14:14.587 --> 14:15.923
WELL, HE DID.
嗯，他做到了。

14:16.957 --> 14:19.126
( laughing )
（笑）

14:19.226 --> 14:23.363
IT IS EVEN FUNNIER
A SECOND TIME.
更有趣
第二次。

14:23.463 --> 14:25.165
YOU, THERE--
CRUSTACEAN!
你，在那里——
甲壳类动物！

14:25.265 --> 14:26.266
WHO, ME?
谁，我？

14:26.366 --> 14:28.735
YOU HAVE THE
PHYSIQUE OF ATLAS.
你有
阿特拉斯的体格。

14:28.835 --> 14:30.103
THANKS. I WORK OUT.
谢谢。我锻炼身体。

14:30.203 --> 14:31.471
( laughing )
（笑）

14:31.571 --> 14:33.506
MAKE POSES WITH ME.
和我一起摆姿势。

14:33.606 --> 14:34.674
OKAY.
好的。

14:34.774 --> 14:36.809
( both grunting )
（两人都咕哝着）

14:38.678 --> 14:40.080
BODY SLAM!
身体猛击！

14:40.180 --> 14:43.083
YOU PULLED THE SPATULA
FROM THE GREASE.
你拉了抹刀
来自油脂。

14:43.183 --> 14:44.985
NOPE, THAT WAS SPONGEBOB.
不，那是海绵宝宝。

14:46.053 --> 14:48.989
THIS JOKE HAS GONE FAR ENOUGH!
这个玩笑已经开得太过了！

14:49.089 --> 14:51.959
WHERE'S
MY FRY COOK?
在哪里
我的炒菜厨师？

14:52.025 --> 14:53.626
CERTAINLY YOU
当然是你

14:53.726 --> 14:55.162
WITH YOUR PRODIGIOUS GIRTH
凭借你惊人的腰围

14:55.262 --> 14:57.197
WOULD KNOW
WHO CAN FLIP A BURGER
会知道
谁可以翻转汉堡

14:57.297 --> 14:58.966
TO SUIT A ROYAL PALATE!
迎合皇室口味！

15:00.968 --> 15:01.634
WHAT?!
什么？！

15:01.734 --> 15:03.370
AM I EXPECTED
TO BELIEVE
我期待吗
相信

15:03.470 --> 15:06.339
THIS CREATURE IS ROYAL
FRY COOK MATERIAL?
这个生物是皇家的
炒菜材料？

15:06.439 --> 15:09.142
I DON'T SUPPOSE
YOU HAVE ANY PROOF.
我不认为
你有任何证据。

15:11.979 --> 15:12.980
HA!
哈！

15:13.080 --> 15:15.548
THIS THING IS UNFIT
TO EVEN SCRUB
这东西不合适
甚至擦洗

15:15.648 --> 15:16.984
THE ROYAL TAIL FIN!
皇家尾鳍！

15:17.017 --> 15:19.486
AND BESIDES, IT'S
NOT JUST ENOUGH
除此之外，它是
还不够

15:19.586 --> 15:22.422
TO PULL A SPATULA OFF
A GREASY GRIDDLE;
拔掉抹刀
油腻的煎锅；

15:22.522 --> 15:24.724
THERE ARE CERTAIN...
QUALITIES
有某些...
品质

15:24.824 --> 15:27.260
THAT A ROYAL FRY
COOK MUST HAVE.
那是皇家炸薯条
厨师必备。

15:27.360 --> 15:28.728
LIKE?
喜欢？

15:28.828 --> 15:31.364
THE ROYAL FRY COOK MUST BE...
皇家油炸厨师一定是……

15:31.464 --> 15:33.466
OH, LEFT-HANDED.
哦，左撇子。

15:33.566 --> 15:36.036
ACTUALLY, I'VE GOT TWO.
事实上，我有两个。

15:36.136 --> 15:37.437
( fingers snapping )
（打响指）

15:37.537 --> 15:40.640
ALSO, THE ROYAL FRY COOK
WEARS... RED UNDERWEAR.
另外，皇家油炸厨师
穿着……红色内衣。

15:40.740 --> 15:42.242
NO, BLUE.
不，蓝色。

15:42.342 --> 15:44.144
OH!
哦！

15:44.244 --> 15:46.013
THE ROYAL FRY COOK'S
WALLET CONTAINS
皇家油炸厨师
钱包包含

15:46.046 --> 15:47.814
HIS BIG TOES...
他的大脚趾...

15:47.914 --> 15:49.482
UH, HE HAS SIX.
呃，他有六个。

15:49.582 --> 15:52.519
HE IS THE NEW
ROYAL FRY COOK
AND YOU...
他是新的
皇家炒菜厨师
而你...

15:52.619 --> 15:54.587
SILENCE!
沉默！

15:54.687 --> 15:57.190
IS IT HOT IN HERE,
OR WHAT?
这里热吗？
或者什么？

15:57.290 --> 15:58.325
( gasps )
（喘气）

15:58.425 --> 15:59.259
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

15:59.359 --> 16:00.860
YOU HURT MY FRIEND!
你伤害了我的朋友！

16:01.028 --> 16:02.262
YOU'RE NOT A KING.
你不是国王。

16:02.362 --> 16:04.031
YOU'RE A BULLY AND A LIAR!
你是一个恶霸和骗子！

16:04.131 --> 16:05.598
SO, LITTLE ONE...
那么，小一...

16:05.698 --> 16:10.470
YOU THINK YOU HAVE
WHAT IT TAKES TO
BE MY FRY COOK.
你认为你有
需要做什么
做我的炒菜厨师吧。

16:10.537 --> 16:13.506
I WILL PROVE YOUR
WORTHLESSNESS.
我会证明你的
无价值。

16:13.606 --> 16:17.077
YOU SHALL BE TESTED
WITH A CHALLENGE!
你将受到考验
有挑战！

16:17.177 --> 16:18.511
Patrick:
BRING IT ON!
帕特里克：
开始吧！

16:18.611 --> 16:21.848
SPONGEBOB CAN HANDLE ANY...
海绵宝宝可以应付任何...

16:21.948 --> 16:23.783
OUCH!
哎哟！

16:23.883 --> 16:28.255
YOUR FRIEND'S ARROGANCE
WILL COST YOU DEARLY.
你朋友的傲慢
会让你付出高昂的代价。

16:28.355 --> 16:31.158
THERE WILL BE
TWO CHALLENGES!
将会有
两个挑战！

16:31.258 --> 16:32.592
Patrick:
ONLY TWO?!
帕特里克：
只有两个？！

16:32.692 --> 16:34.527
WHAT ARE TWO
CHALLENGES
什么是两个
挑战

16:34.627 --> 16:36.729
TO SOMEONE
LIKE SPONGEBOB?
致某人
喜欢海绵宝宝吗？

16:36.829 --> 16:38.765
THREE CHALLENGES!
三大挑战！

16:38.865 --> 16:40.067
Patrick:
THREE?!
帕特里克：
三？！

16:40.133 --> 16:41.568
( laughing )
（笑）

16:41.668 --> 16:44.171
THREE CHALLENGES
ARE NOTHING.
三大挑战
什么都不是。

16:44.271 --> 16:47.107
MIGHT AS WELL BE
500 CHALLENGES!
也可能是
500 个挑战！

16:47.207 --> 16:49.176
ENOUGH!
足够的！

16:49.276 --> 16:51.078
HE'LL SETTLE FOR ONE.
他会选择一个。

16:51.144 --> 16:55.715
THERE WILL BE
BUT ONE CHALLENGE:
将会有
但有一个挑战：

16:55.815 --> 16:58.518
YOU WILL FACE ME IN...
你将在……中面对我

16:58.618 --> 17:01.088
THE ULTIMATE COOK-OFF!
终极烹饪大赛！

17:01.121 --> 17:03.090
I WILL ACCEPT YOUR CHALLENGE
我会接受你的挑战

17:03.190 --> 17:04.691
IF YOU FIX MY FRIEND.
如果你修好了我的朋友。

17:04.791 --> 17:06.093
Neptune:
AH, YES...
海王星：
啊，是的...

17:06.159 --> 17:08.295
THE ROUND ONE.
第一轮。

17:08.395 --> 17:10.597
I SHALL RESTORE HIM.
我会恢复他的状态。

17:11.798 --> 17:12.765
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

17:12.865 --> 17:13.800
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

17:13.900 --> 17:14.934
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

17:15.102 --> 17:15.935
OH, THERE YOU ARE.
哦，你来了。

17:16.103 --> 17:16.936
HOW YOU FEELING?
你感觉怎么样？

17:17.104 --> 17:17.870
PRETTY GOOD.
不错。

17:17.970 --> 17:19.439
SAY, HAVE YOU
GOTTEN TALLER?
说，你有吗
长高了吗？

17:19.539 --> 17:20.640
AND NOW...
现在...

17:20.740 --> 17:24.111
SEE THE FATE
THAT MAY LIE AHEAD.
看命运
这可能就在眼前。

17:25.312 --> 17:29.216
FOR, IF BY SOME MINUTE CHANCE,
YOU MEET THE CHALLENGE
因为，如果有一分钟的机会，
您迎接挑战

17:29.316 --> 17:32.152
YOUR REWARD WILL BE GREAT.
您的回报将是巨大的。

17:32.252 --> 17:33.520
BEHOLD!
看哪！

17:33.620 --> 17:35.722
( screaming )
（尖叫）

17:35.822 --> 17:37.257
WOOPSIE!
哎呀！

17:37.324 --> 17:39.192
NOW BEHOLD--
现在看——

17:39.292 --> 17:42.629
MY BELOVED HOME
OF ATLANTIS.
我心爱的家
亚特兰蒂斯。

17:42.729 --> 17:44.897
A PRIZE WORTHY OF APOLLO.
值得阿波罗的奖品。

17:44.997 --> 17:48.768
YOU WILL RESIDE HERE
IN THIS GLORIOUS PLACE
您将居住在这里
在这个辉煌的地方

17:48.868 --> 17:51.538
COOK ONLY FOR ME
AND BE A GOD!
只为我做饭
并成为神！

17:51.604 --> 17:53.673
HEY, THAT SOUNDS
PRETTY GOOD.
嘿，听起来
非常好。

17:53.773 --> 17:56.143
BUT IF YOU SHOULD
NOT SUCCEED...
但如果你应该
没有成功...

17:56.209 --> 17:58.811
YOU MUST GIVE UP FRY COOKING...
你必须放弃油炸烹饪......

17:58.911 --> 18:00.847
FOREVER.
永远。

18:00.947 --> 18:02.249
WHAT DO YOU SAY?
你怎么说？

18:02.349 --> 18:04.917
I'M READY!
我准备好了！

18:05.017 --> 18:07.019
VERY WELL, THEN!
那么，很好！

18:07.154 --> 18:09.756
TO THE POSEIDOME!
到波塞多美！

18:10.823 --> 18:12.825
Announcer:
LADIES AND GENTLEMEN
播音员：
女士们、先生们

18:12.925 --> 18:16.163
WELCOME TO
THE ULTIMATE COOK-OFF!
欢迎来到
终极烹饪大赛！

18:16.229 --> 18:17.964
( cheering and whistling )
（欢呼声和口哨声）

18:18.064 --> 18:18.998
ALL RIGHT, MATES
好吧，伙计们

18:19.166 --> 18:20.967
FIRST TO A THOUSAND PATTIES
WINS.
第一个一千个肉饼
获胜。

18:21.067 --> 18:22.269
SHAKE HANDS.
握手。

18:23.069 --> 18:24.337
( rumbling )
（隆隆声）

18:24.437 --> 18:27.607
MAY THE BEST MAN WIN.
愿最好的人获胜。

18:27.707 --> 18:29.176
NOW GO BACK TO YOUR CORNERS
现在回到你的角落

18:29.209 --> 18:31.711
AND WHEN THE BELL SOUNDS,
COME OUT COOKING!
当铃声响起时，
出来做饭！

18:31.811 --> 18:32.779
DON'T WORRY, LAD.
别担心，小伙子。

18:32.879 --> 18:34.781
I HAVE TOTAL CONFIDENCE IN YOU.
我对你充满信心。

18:34.881 --> 18:36.783
PUT IT ALL ON NEPTUNE!
把一切都放在海王星上！

18:36.883 --> 18:39.486
I'M NOT GOOD ENOUGH
TO COOK IN ATLANTIS, PATRICK.
我还不够好
在亚特兰蒂斯做饭，帕特里克。

18:39.586 --> 18:41.688
I NEVER SHOULD HAVE
TAKEN THE CHALLENGE.
我永远不应该
接受挑战。

18:41.788 --> 18:44.557
DON'T GIVE UP YOUR
DREAM, SPONGEBOB.
不要放弃你的
梦想吧，海绵宝宝。

18:44.657 --> 18:46.293
PEOPLE USED TO TELL ME:
人们曾经告诉我：

18:46.393 --> 18:48.795
"PATRICK, YOU'LL NEVER
AMOUNT TO ANYTHING.
“帕特里克，你永远不会
任何金额。

18:48.895 --> 18:51.464
YOU'LL ALWAYS HAVE
YOUR HEAD IN THE CLOUDS."
你将永远拥有
你的头在云端。”

18:51.564 --> 18:53.500
BUT JUST LOOK
AT ME NOW.
但只要看看
现在就在我身边。

18:53.600 --> 18:55.968
( bell dings )
GO GET 'EM, TIGER!
（铃声响起）
GO GET 'EM, TIGER!

18:58.070 --> 18:59.472
( rumbling )
（隆隆声）

19:52.425 --> 19:53.960
( laughing )
（笑）

20:04.571 --> 20:05.738
"ONCE UPON A TIME..."
“曾几何时...”

20:05.838 --> 20:08.508
( laughing )
（笑）

20:10.209 --> 20:12.144
PERFECT.
完美的。

20:14.013 --> 20:15.582
I WIN!
我赢了！

20:15.682 --> 20:16.916
( whooping )
（呼喊）

20:17.016 --> 20:18.785
( laughing )
（笑）

20:22.822 --> 20:24.123
LOSER!
失败者！

20:24.223 --> 20:25.992
( laughing )
（笑）

20:26.092 --> 20:28.928
FREE PATTIES
FOR EVERYONE!
免费肉饼
为了每个人！

20:29.028 --> 20:30.863
( cheering and applause )
（欢呼和掌声）

20:30.963 --> 20:33.099
( all cheering )
（大家欢呼）

20:40.273 --> 20:42.942
FOOLS! HAVE YOU NO TASTE BUDS?
傻瓜！你没有味蕾吗？

20:43.042 --> 20:45.011
THERE'S NOTHING WRONG
WITH THESE.
没有什么问题
有了这些。

20:45.111 --> 20:46.646
THEY'RE DELICIOUS!
它们很好吃！

20:46.746 --> 20:49.849
Fish:
TOO CHICKEN TO EAT
HIS OWN BURGER!
鱼：
鸡肉太难吃了
他自己的汉堡！

20:49.949 --> 20:51.150
Fish 2:
WHY DON'T YOU EAT IT?
鱼2：
你为什么不吃它？

20:51.250 --> 20:53.219
( chanting ):
EAT IT! EAT IT!
（念诵）：
吃它！吃它！

20:53.320 --> 20:56.956
OKAY, MINE'S NO GOOD.
好吧，我的不行。

20:57.056 --> 21:00.159
BUT WHAT MAKES YOU THINK
HIS WILL BE ANY BETTER?
但你为什么会这么想
他的情况会更好吗？

21:00.259 --> 21:01.761
GIVE ME THAT!
给我那个！

21:07.233 --> 21:08.935
MMM!
嗯！

21:09.035 --> 21:11.103
WHY, IT TASTES SO GOOD
为什么，味道这么好

21:11.203 --> 21:14.941
I THINK I'D LIKE TO TRY IT
A SECOND TIME.
我想我想尝试一下
第二次。

21:16.343 --> 21:18.645
( all groaning )
（大家都在呻吟）

21:18.745 --> 21:20.547
SO, UH... WHAT
DO YOU THINK?
那么，呃...什么
你觉得吗？

21:20.647 --> 21:23.816
YOURS IS SUPERIOR.
你的更优秀。

21:23.916 --> 21:26.819
THEREFORE,
I CONCEDE TO YOU--
因此，
我向你承认——

21:26.919 --> 21:29.989
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS,
YOU WIN.
海绵宝宝，
你赢了。

21:30.089 --> 21:31.824
( cheering )
（欢呼）

21:31.924 --> 21:32.892
YAY!
YAY!
耶！
耶！

21:32.992 --> 21:35.528
Both:
WE'RE GOING TO ATLANTIS!
两者：
我们要去亚特兰蒂斯！

21:35.628 --> 21:37.630
WE'RE GOING TO ATLANTIS!
我们要去亚特兰蒂斯！

21:37.730 --> 21:38.865
( Neptune laughing )
（海王星笑）

21:38.965 --> 21:39.799
WHAT'S SO FUNNY?
有什么好笑的？

21:39.932 --> 21:41.668
YOU, SPONGEBOB.
你，海绵宝宝。

21:41.768 --> 21:43.370
THAT REPULSIVE THING
那个令人厌恶的东西

21:43.436 --> 21:45.171
IN MY PALACE?!
在我的宫殿里？！

21:45.271 --> 21:47.740
YOU MEAN PATRICK
CAN'T COME?
你是说帕特里克
不能来吗？

21:47.840 --> 21:49.709
( laughing )
（笑）

21:49.809 --> 21:52.579
OH, OF COURSE NOT.
哦，当然不是。

21:52.679 --> 21:53.780
AND MY FRIENDS...?
还有我的朋友们……？

21:53.880 --> 21:56.683
AH, THE ONLY FRIEND YOU'LL NEED,
MY DEAR BOY
啊，你唯一需要的朋友，
我亲爱的男孩

21:56.783 --> 21:58.618
IS THE ROYAL GRILL.
是皇家烧烤餐厅。

21:58.718 --> 22:00.920
IT WAS NICE
KNOWING YOU, BUDDY.
很好
认识你，伙计。

22:01.020 --> 22:03.856
( wailing )
（哀号）

22:03.956 --> 22:04.957
I KNOW, MR. KRABS.
我知道，先生。螃蟹。

22:05.057 --> 22:06.225
I'LL MISS YOU, TOO.
我也会想念你的。

22:06.393 --> 22:07.894
I LOST ME BET!
我赌输了！

22:07.994 --> 22:09.662
( crying )
（哭）

22:09.762 --> 22:11.564
COME, SPONGEBOB,
GRAB YOUR THINGS.
来吧，海绵宝宝，
拿好你的东西。

22:11.664 --> 22:14.634
IT'S TIME TO DEPART...
是时候出发了...

22:14.734 --> 22:16.636
TO ATLANTIS!
前往亚特兰蒂斯！

22:16.736 --> 22:17.737
( crowd cheering )
（人群欢呼）

22:17.837 --> 22:18.805
I... I...
我...我...

22:18.905 --> 22:23.743
( sobbing ):
I DON'T WANT TO GO!
（抽泣）：
我不想去！

22:23.843 --> 22:25.177
IT'S TOO LATE NOW.
现在已经太晚了。

22:25.277 --> 22:28.180
I CAN'T LIVE
WITHOUT YOUR BURGERS.
我无法活下去
没有你的汉堡。

22:28.280 --> 22:30.717
YOU'RE GOING TO BE A GOD
你将成为神

22:30.817 --> 22:32.919
AND LIKE IT!
喜欢它！

22:36.756 --> 22:38.425
MAYBE WE DO HAVE A PROBLEM.
也许我们确实有问题。

22:38.491 --> 22:40.660
( booming voice ):
WAIT, NEPTUNE!
（洪亮的声音）：
等等，海王星！

22:40.760 --> 22:42.729
I HAVE ANOTHER IDEA.
我有另一个想法。

22:46.433 --> 22:48.435
GOOD MORNING, KRUSTY CREW.
早上好，Krusty 船员。

22:48.468 --> 22:50.102
HI, PATRICK.
WHAT'LL YOU HAVE?
嗨，帕特里克。
你会得到什么？

22:50.202 --> 22:51.471
UH...
呃……

22:51.571 --> 22:53.540
( Neptune hollers )
（海王星呐喊）

22:53.640 --> 22:54.707
CAN YOU EXCUSE ME?
你能原谅我吗？

22:54.807 --> 22:57.744
THE ACCURSED STOVE
HAS BURNT MY FINGER.
被诅咒的火炉
我的手指被烧伤了。

22:57.844 --> 23:00.112
FEEL THINE OWN WRATH,
STOVE!
感受你自己的愤怒，
炉子！

23:00.212 --> 23:02.081
( rumbling )
HA-HA!
（隆隆声）
哈哈！

23:02.181 --> 23:05.785
WHAT DID I TELL YOU ABOUT
USING YOUR POWERS, TRAINEE?
我告诉过你什么了
使用你的权力吗，受训者？

23:05.885 --> 23:10.890
PERFECT PATTIES ARE MADE
WITH LOVE, NOT MAGIC.
完美的肉饼已制作完成
用爱，而不是魔法。

23:14.661 --> 23:17.930
